      "path": {
        "alias": "/news/2024/03/council-approves-budget",
        "pid": 141,
        "langcode": "en"
      },
      "body": {
        "value": "<p>The City Council voted 9-2 on Thursday&nbsp;to approve a $2 million budget.</p>\r\n<p>The plan adds three parks in &ldquo;underserved&rdquo; neighborhoods.</p>",
        "format": "full_html",
        "processed": "<p>The City Council voted 9-2 on Thursday&nbsp;to approve a $2 million budget.</p>\n<p>The plan adds three parks in &ldquo;underserved&rdquo; neighborhoods.</p>\n<script>window.dataLayer.push({event: 'article'});</script>",
